## Description

Found a fun way to generate QR codes that don’t look like QR codes.  - Enter a URL and it grows a 3D tree from the code itself - The ground grid is the actual scannable QR - Switch between Spring, Summer, and Autumn looks - Runs fully in the browser, nothing uploaded - Tap the https://t.co/UdSii4N75H

